{"unit_id":"langyo__dsh-mobile-upgrade#feature-1","repo":"langyo/dsh-mobile-upgrade","commit":"93746c6980f20bcc6d39cfcb17f55fdeff54a","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-mobile-upgrade 的功能「手机侧边栏」：在窄屏用浮动按钮打开完整侧栏抽屉，并支持从按钮所在一侧滑入。点击按钮触发，供用户浏览和切换会话。","source":"generated","evidence":["client/client.js:389-400","client/client.js:646-655"]}
